== Recent News

- \[March 2021\] Two papers accepted at [http://www.icra2021.org/ ICRA 2021]! Check out our work on [https://arxiv.org/abs/2012.06738 Multi-Arm RoboTurk] and [https://arxiv.org/abs/2011.08424 Deep Affordance Foresight].

- \[March 2021\] New [https://arxiv.org/abs/2103.00375 preprint] on enabling spatial generalization in visuomotor control from human demonstrations using a structured hand-eye action space.

- \[December 2020\] We recently extended [https://roboturk.stanford.edu/ RoboTurk] to enable [https://arxiv.org/abs/2012.06733 human-in-the-loop teleoperation] and developed Intervention Weighted Regression, a simple and effective algorithm to learn from such interventions.

- \[September 2020\] We released [https://robosuite.ai robosuite] v1.0, a modular simulation framework and benchmark for robot learning.

- \[July 2020\] We are organizing the [https://sites.google.com/utexas.edu/rss-2020-imitation-learning/home?authuser=0 Advances and Challenges in Imitation Learning for Robotics] workshop at [https://roboticsconference.org/ RSS 2020].

== About Me

I am a PhD candidate in the [http://svl.stanford.edu/ Stanford Vision and Learning Lab] advised by [http://cvgl.stanford.edu/silvio/ Silvio Savarese] and [http://vision.stanford.edu/feifeili/ Fei-Fei Li]. I work on building systems and algorithms to allow robots to leverage human insight for manipulation. 

